 '20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012',1,'published',
 'Distinguish a desired future user experience from a list of features, then draft a brief vision direction.',
 '[{"type":"heading","text":"Start with the change. Then think about features."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A product vision describes a future worth working toward. It helps people connect today’s decisions to a shared direction. A feature list tells you what might be built; the vision explains the change those features should help create."},{"type":"callout","title":"A quick comparison","text":"“Add badges and video playlists” names features. “Help designers turn fragmented learning into confident decisions at work” describes an intended future benefit."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A one-sentence statement is a starting exercise, not a complete strategic vision. Strong vision work also needs a richer picture of the future and context for trade-offs."}]'::jsonb,
 '[{"id":"vision-benefit","prompt":"A team is designing a learning companion for working designers. Which option best expresses the intended future benefit?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Ship a streak counter, ten badges, and video playlists."},{"id":"b","text":"Help designers turn fragmented learning into confident decisions they can apply at work."},{"id":"c","text":"Increase this month’s registrations by 15%."}]}]'::jsonb,
 '[{"id":"review-1","prompt":"Which statement is closest to a product vision?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Add a dashboard and five filters."},{"id":"b","text":"Help new designers make clearer decisions with evidence."},{"id":"c","text":"Reach 1,000 signups this quarter."}]},{"id":"review-2","prompt":"A vision is most useful when it helps the team…","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Choose between product trade-offs."},{"id":"b","text":"Count shipped features."},{"id":"c","text":"Avoid talking to users."}]}]'::jsonb,
